{"4314390":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"I Trust You Buddy","steam_appid":4314390,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About this game:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your buddy sees the way. You take the step. You both face the consequences.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I Trust You Buddy is an online co-op horror, puzzle, and platforming game where two players share a single body. One player controls movement, while the other controls vision and interactions. Getting through each challenge takes clear communication, careful coordination, and trust.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wrong direction can lead you into a trap. An early jump can send you both into the void. Sometimes, surviving means standing still and waiting quietly together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Labiland: Explore dark corridors, find keys and clues, and solve circuit puzzles. Hide beneath tables as a relentless creature searches for you, and plan your escape together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mazeland: Keep your bearings through changing labyrinths. Search for keys, piece together words, unlock doors, and navigate increasingly dangerous traps.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Upland: Cross moving platforms, climb winding routes, and time your jumps above the void. Watch the giant Watcher’s shadow as it prepares to strike, and reach safety before impact.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use sonar, your pen, and the shared brake ability together. The blind player must complete rhythmic seals in Silence the Monster Within to restore their strength, while their buddy keeps watch for approaching danger.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player’s mistake can bring you both down. Every well-timed step brings you closer to escape.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About this game:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your buddy sees the way. You take the step. You both face the consequences.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I Trust You Buddy is an online co-op horror, puzzle, and platforming game where two players share a single body. One player controls movement, while the other controls vision and interactions. Getting through each challenge takes clear communication, careful coordination, and trust.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wrong direction can lead you into a trap. An early jump can send you both into the void. Sometimes, surviving means standing still and waiting quietly together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Labiland: Explore dark corridors, find keys and clues, and solve circuit puzzles. Hide beneath tables as a relentless creature searches for you, and plan your escape together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mazeland: Keep your bearings through changing labyrinths. Search for keys, piece together words, unlock doors, and navigate increasingly dangerous traps.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Upland: Cross moving platforms, climb winding routes, and time your jumps above the void. Watch the giant Watcher’s shadow as it prepares to strike, and reach safety before impact.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use sonar, your pen, and the shared brake ability together. The blind player must complete rhythmic seals in Silence the Monster Within to restore their strength, while their buddy keeps watch for approaching danger.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player’s mistake can bring you both down. Every well-timed step brings you closer to escape.<\/p>","short_description":"One body. Two players. One controls movement; the other sees the way. Communicate, solve puzzles, and survive dark corridors, shifting mazes, and dangerous platforming challenges. Your next step depends on your buddy.","supported_languages":"English, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4314390\/2661d6bb6ec7af6d8a37